<title>UK: WestLB sets 1.0 billion mark Dec 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets 1.0 billion mark Dec 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank, DGZ, Landesbank Hessen Thueringen, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    16.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.53     PAY DATE  S-16.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    97.31     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  22 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT NOVEMBER 2004 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF REIHE 7504</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
